    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_academic_discussion_thesis",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-academic-discussion-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "The thesis is clear, but the argument needs a stronger explanation of why this evidence is relevant to the central claim."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "تز روشنه، ولی استدلال باید بهتر توضیح بده چرا این شواهد به ادعای اصلی مربوطه."
        },
        "intent": "evaluate_thesis",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_academic_discussion_thesis",
          "c1_academic_discussion_relevance"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_academic_discussion_premise",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-academic-discussion-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "I would challenge the premise that efficiency and fairness necessarily move in opposite directions."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "پیش‌فرض اینکه کارایی و عدالت لزوماً در جهت مخالف حرکت می‌کنن رو به چالش می‌کشم."
        },
        "intent": "challenge_premise",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_academic_discussion_premise",
          "c1_academic_discussion_challenge"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_academic_discussion_criterion",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-academic-discussion-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "We appear to be evaluating the studies by different criteria, which may explain why we reach different judgments."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "به نظر میاد مطالعات رو با معیارهای متفاوت ارزیابی می‌کنیم و شاید دلیل قضاوت متفاوت همین باشه."
        },
        "intent": "surface_criterion",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_academic_discussion_criterion",
          "c1_academic_discussion_interpretation"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_academic_discussion_subst",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-academic-discussion-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "That interpretation is plausible, but I do not think the current data substantiate it strongly enough."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اون تفسیر قابل‌قبوله، ولی فکر نمی‌کنم داده فعلی به اندازه کافی قوی پشتیبانیش کنه."
        },
        "intent": "request_support",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_academic_discussion_interpretation",
          "c1_academic_discussion_substantiate"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_academic_discussion_framework",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-academic-discussion-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Within that framework, the result looks contradictory; under a different framework, the two findings can coexist."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "داخل اون چارچوب نتیجه متناقض به نظر میاد؛ در چارچوب دیگه، دو یافته می‌تونن کنار هم وجود داشته باشن."
        },
        "intent": "compare_frameworks",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_academic_discussion_framework",
          "c1_academic_discussion_interpretation"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_academic_discussion_relevance",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-academic-discussion-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "A detail can be accurate without being relevant to the question the discussion is trying to answer."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "یک جزئیات می‌تونه دقیق باشه بدون اینکه به سؤالی که بحث می‌خواد جواب بده مرتبط باشه."
        },
        "intent": "distinguish_relevance",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_academic_discussion_relevance",
          "c1_academic_discussion_criterion"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_academic_discussion_challenge2",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-academic-discussion-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "I am challenging the inference, not the quality of the research itself."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "من استنباط رو به چالش می‌کشم، نه کیفیت خود تحقیق رو."
