    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_academic_discussion_advanced_reporting",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-academic-discussion-01",
        "slug": "c1-academic-discussion-advanced-reporting",
        "title": "Advanced reporting verbs",
        "rule_summary": "Choose reporting verbs such as acknowledge, maintain, concede, dispute, imply, and caution to represent a source's stance accurately.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "برای بازتاب دقیق موضع منبع از فعل‌هایی مثل acknowledge، maintain، concede، dispute، imply و caution استفاده می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The author acknowledges the limitation but maintains that the trend is meaningful.",
            "fa": "نویسنده محدودیت را می‌پذیرد اما همچنان معتقد است روند معنادار است."
          },
          {
            "en": "The report cautions against treating correlation as proof of cause.",
            "fa": "گزارش هشدار می‌دهد همبستگی را به‌عنوان اثبات علت در نظر نگیریم."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_academic_discussion_discourse_management",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-academic-discussion-02",
        "slug": "c1-academic-discussion-discourse-management",
        "title": "Managing complex discourse",
        "rule_summary": "Use signposting and metadiscourse to frame, sequence, return to, and close complex points without losing the listener.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با signposting و metadiscourse نکات پیچیده را قاب‌بندی، مرتب، دوباره جمع و نتیجه‌گیری می‌کنیم تا شنونده مسیر بحث را گم نکند."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Before I come back to that point, let me clarify one assumption.",
            "fa": "قبل از اینکه به آن نکته برگردم، بگذار یک فرض را روشن کنم."
          },
          {
            "en": "That brings us to the broader question of accountability.",
            "fa": "این ما را به پرسش گسترده‌تر پاسخ‌گویی می‌رساند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_academic_discussion_nominalisation",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-academic-discussion-03",
        "slug": "c1-academic-discussion-nominalisation",
        "title": "Nominalisation in formal discourse",
        "rule_summary": "Turn verbs or adjectives into noun phrases to make formal arguments more compact and abstract when appropriate.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "در گفتار و نوشتار رسمی، در صورت مناسب بودن فعل یا صفت را به عبارت اسمی تبدیل می‌کنیم تا استدلال فشرده‌تر و انتزاعی‌تر شود."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The rapid expansion of the service created new risks.",
            "fa": "گسترش سریع سرویس ریسک‌های جدیدی ایجاد کرد."
          },
          {
            "en": "A reduction in waiting times would benefit everyone.",
            "fa": "کاهش زمان انتظار به نفع همه خواهد بود."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c1_academic_discussion_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-academic-discussion-01",
        "title": "Academic Discussion: part 1",
        "setting": "podcast planning call",
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "school-study",
        "characters": [
          "Nora",
          "Samir"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Nora",
            "text": "Where do you think the strongest part of the case is?",
            "translation_fa": "فکر می‌کنی قوی‌ترین بخش استدلال کجاست؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Samir",
            "text": "The thesis is clear, but the argument needs a stronger explanation of why this evidence is relevant to the central claim.",
            "translation_fa": "تز روشنه، ولی استدلال باید بهتر توضیح بده چرا این شواهد به ادعای اصلی مربوطه."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Nora",
            "text": "And where would you qualify it?",
            "translation_fa": "و کجاش رو با احتیاط یا قید بیشتری بیان می‌کردی؟"
